The native MLX runtime under native/laya_rust ports the architecture of
laya-mlx (https://github.com/mizorewww/laya-mlx, Apache-2.0), which itself
converts Laya (https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya, Apache-2.0,
by Convai Innovations and contributors). Model weights are fetched
separately from aac6fef/laya-mlx (Apache-2.0) and are never redistributed
by this package. MLX and mlx-swift are Apple software (MIT/Apache-2.0).
